
Week 3 Data Preparation and Quality Checks

Project

Research question:
Which settlements in Ibadan North Local Government Area sit in low-lying land within 200 metres of a watercourse?

Study area: Ibadan North LGA, Oyo State, Nigeria



1. Working CRS

Chosen CRS: WGS 84 / UTM Zone 31N — EPSG:32631

EPSG:32631 was selected as the working coordinate reference system because the study area is in southwestern Nigeria and falls within UTM Zone 31N. The projected CRS provides coordinates in metres, which is appropriate for distance-based analysis such as the 200 m watercourse buffer and for measuring areas and distances.

The original Copernicus DEM is supplied in geographic WGS 84 (EPSG:4326), so it was reprojected to the selected working CRS before analysis.

